## 1. Software Code License (Source-Available, Strict Non-Compete)

Subject strictly to all limitations in this License, Devilabs ("Licensor") grants you a
limited, revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable license solely to:

1. **Inspect and Audit:** Read and review the source code to verify privacy guarantees,
   telemetry behavior, and security properties.
2. **Personal Non-Commercial Use:** Compile and run the Software solely on your own personal
   devices for private, non-commercial, non-production use.
3. **Upstream Contributions:** Fork and submit pull requests directly back to the official
   Hodos repository (`https://github.com/DrSkyle/hodos`).

### Strict Prohibitions (What You May NOT Do Without a Signed Written Commercial License)

You may NOT, directly or indirectly, in whole or in part:

1. **No Commercial Use:** Use, copy, modify, host, integrate, or deploy the Software, its
   signal-processing algorithms (`@hodos/core` detector, severity grading, vibration/IRI
   inference, H3 aggregation pipeline), UI/UX, or backend functions for any commercial,
   revenue-generating, enterprise, governmental, or internal business purpose.
2. **No Competing Products or Services:** Build, operate, assist, or distribute any product,
   mobile app, web app, API, SDK, dataset, or SaaS platform that competes with Hodos—including
   passive road-condition mapping, pothole/hazard detection, road-quality scoring, live driver
   road alerts, or roadside local-shop pin/Garage directories.
3. **No Redistribution or Re-Publishing:** Redistribute, republish, repackage, wrap,
   white-label, sublicense, sell, rent, or publish any modified or unmodified binary or source
   copy of the Software (including APK, AAB, IPA, or hosted web deployments) on any app store,
   package registry, mirror, or website.
4. **No Scraping, Mirroring, or AI/ML Model Training:** Scrape, bulk-export, mirror, resell,
   or use this codebase, the Hodos API, or any Hodos road-condition data to train, fine-tune,
   distill, benchmark, or evaluate any competing AI, machine-learning, routing, navigation,
   or computer-vision model.
5. **No Circumvention or Attribution Removal:** Remove, obscure, or alter any copyright notice,
   license file, brand mark, API metering mechanism, GPS verification gate, or privacy trim.

