Commercial use of the dataset, live API feeds, or derived layers—including commercial vehicle
routing, fleet dispatch, ride-hailing, logistics, insurance telematics, municipal contractor
tooling, navigation apps, or data reselling—is strictly prohibited without a paid commercial
license or authorized prepaid API agreement from Devilabs.

